  lx_pre. lxr_abase. lxr_pose. lx_pre.
  lx_run_tac (PLAN [0xb09b8; 0xb08e8; 0xa8b70] [] 300%N). lx_tree.
  all: lxu_chk_leaves 0xb08e8.
  all: lazymatch goal with |- context [MS _ _ (Z_to_bv 64 0xb09b8) _ _ _ (seg_rom _)] => gpa_epi | |- _ => idtac end.
  pose proof OEC as OE'. unfold oid_lookup1_stmtA, A_OID_GET_EC_GRP_ALGID in OE'.
  gpa_oid OE' FB h1 sp1 GA ECS ETOP. clear OE'.
  lx_pre. lxr_abase. lxr_pose. lx_pre.
  lx_run_tac (PLAN [0xb09b8; 0xb08e8] [] 300%N). lx_tree.
  all: lxu_chk_leaves 0xb08e8.
  all: lazymatch goal with |- context [MS _ _ (Z_to_bv 64 0xb09b8) _ _ _ (seg_rom _)] => gpa_epi | |- _ => idtac end.
